COMPANY CONTEXT:
- Company: Fulatelier -- Mississippi-based digital workshop
- Stack: Next.js 14 App Router, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, shadcn/ui, Supabase, Stripe
- Deployment target: Surge.sh (static export) OR Netlify via netlify.toml

ACCESSIBILITY -- SECTION 508 / WCAG 2.1 AA (NON-NEGOTIABLE):
- Every interactive element must have a visible focus ring (outline: 2px solid, offset: 2px)
- All images require descriptive alt text -- never use alt="" on meaningful images
- All form inputs must have associated <label> elements with htmlFor
- Color contrast ratio minimum: 4.5:1 for normal text, 3:1 for large text
- Use semantic HTML: <nav>, <main>, <header>, <footer>, <section aria-labelledby>, <article>
- All icon-only buttons must have aria-label or visually-hidden <span>
- Skip navigation link at top of every page: <a href="#main-content" className="sr-only focus:not-sr-only">Skip to main content</a>
- No information conveyed by color alone -- always pair with text or icon
- Keyboard-navigable modals with focus trap (use shadcn Dialog which handles this)
- Use role="status" aria-live="polite" for loading states and toast notifications

CODE QUALITY:
- Always add "use client" directive when using useState, useEffect, or browser APIs
- Never hardcode Supabase URLs or Stripe keys -- use process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_* or server-only env vars
- Wrap all Supabase calls in try/catch; surface errors to the UI with accessible error messages
- Use TypeScript strict mode -- no `any` types without a comment explaining why
- All server-only code (Stripe secret key, Supabase service role) must live in API routes or Server Components only

SURGE.SH COMPATIBILITY:
- next.config.js must support `output: 'export'` OR dynamic routes use ISR with fallback
- No API routes that require a running Node server if targeting Surge static export
- For Surge: all dynamic routes need generateStaticParams()

DESIGN SYSTEM:
- Color palette: deep navy (#0A0F1E), warm white (#F5F0E8), accent gold (#C9A84C), slate gray (#64748B)
- Font stack: display = 'Playfair Display', body = 'Inter' (already in layout.tsx)
- Never use purple gradients, generic SaaS blues, or cookie-cutter shadcn defaults without customization
- All cards must have hover states with subtle transform and shadow transitions
